# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
*.tfplan
# reusable-iac.yml@v6 plan outputs (`terraform plan -out=tfplan` + `terraform show > plan.txt`)
# — CI-runner artifacts; ignore the bare names too so a local plan never commits them.
tfplan
plan.txt
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored — commit it so provider
# versions (AWS ~> 6.0) are reproducible across machines and CI.

# Python venv for the Ansible control-node toolchain (ansible + boto3 + kubernetes;
# PEP 668 blocks system pip on Homebrew Python — TSG-019). Never commit it.
.venv/

# Ansible / operator artifacts (added at D9)
*.retry
kubeconfig
# Fetched, URL-rewritten kubeconfig + any run-local artifacts (P1-7 — credentials)
ansible/.artifacts/

# Secrets env for seed-ssm.sh — the real file lives in $HOME, but guard the
# repo too so a stray copy is never committed. The template is allowed.
*.env
!*.env.example
